              "description": "<ul>\n<li>Changed bundle loading methods for Static Spawn Service and Audio Service to load using SPT’s BundleManager, should alleviate any fika issues. <strong>THIS WILL REQUIRE ANYONE WHO USES THESE SERVICES TO REGISTER THEIR BUNDLE IN THE BUNDLES.JSON PROPERLY, PLEASE CONSULT THE README</strong></li>\n<li>Implemented new Custom Customization Service, with support for Hideout Customizations such as floors, ceilings, walls, and shooting range marks, as well as normal customization items like dogtags and such.</li>\n</ul>\n",
